flowchart LR
    A([messageCreate]) --> B[recordMessage: extract significant words]
    B --> C{channel has word log?}
    C -->|no| D[create new log]
    C -->|yes| E[append words, trim to window]
    D --> F[continue message processing]
    E --> F

    F --> G{evaluate fatigue}
    G --> H[count word frequencies in channel log]
    H --> I{any word >= threshold?}
    I -->|no| J[no fatigue: normal delay/ignore]
    I -->|yes| K[fatigue active]
    K --> L[delay × multiplier]
    K --> M[ignore chance + bonus]
